          "name": "Copy Island",
          "type": "TFunctionRef<void ( int,TArray<int32>& )>"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Uniformly scale all UV islands so that the largest fits in positive-unit-square,\nand translate each islands separately so that it's bbox-min is at the origin.\nSo the islands are \"stacked\" and all fit in the unit box."
